 of International Cooperative Alliance (ICA) as its Elected Member, Board of Directors. This is the third time in a row that Aditya Yadav had won the Global Board Elections.\n• ICA is a Global body of Cooperatives based in Brussels, Belgium consisting of more than 100 countries of the world. Aditya Yadav had been part of International Committees of Ica and also International Cooperative Entrepreneurship Think Tank (ICETT). \n• Apart from this, he had been Member on the Board of many Large and small cooperatives of India.","interests":"None","hobbies":"None","sports":"None","books":"None","countries_visited":"Buenos Aires, Argentina, Kunming , China, Antalaya, Turkey, Stockholm, Sweden, Quebec, Canada, Sofia, Bulgaria, Beijing, China, Yangoon, Burma, Kathmandu, Nepal, Bangkok, Thailand, Singapore, Hanoi,Vietnam, Manila, Phillipines, Montreal, Canada, Colombo, Sri Lanka, Paris,France, Rome,Italy, Madrid,Spain, Tokyo, Japan, Brussels, Belgium, Kigali, Rwanda, Brussels, Belgium, Punta Cana, Dominican Republic, Seville, Spain, Sofia, Bulgaria","terms":"18","num_terms":1,"video":{"direct_url":null,"search_url":"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Sansad+TV+Aditya+Yadav+Lok+Sabha+MP+oath+2024","status":"search_link_only","yt_id":null},"source_profile":"https://sansad.in/ls/members/biographyM/5802","source_positions":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=5802&locale=en","positions":[{"period":"25 Feb 2026 Onwards","position":"Member, India– Poland Parliamentary Friendship Group","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=5802&locale=en"},{"period":"26-Sep-2024 onwards","position":"Member, Committee on Coal, Mines and Steel","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=5802&locale=en"},{"period":"June 2024","position":"Elected to 18th Lok Sabha","source":"https://sansad.in/api_ls/member/positionHeld?mpCode=5802&locale=en"}],"local_photo":"/data/photos/5802.jpg","mpid":5802,"house":"Lok Sabha","member_key":"ls-5802",